      ],
      "type": "object",
    },
    "promptGuidelines": undefined,
    "promptSnippet": "Message sibling subagents in your run",
  },
  {
    "description": "Contact the supervisor (parent agent). Use reason "need_decision" when you are blocked and need the parent to decide — the call blocks until the parent replies (10 minute timeout, after which you must decide yourself). Use reason "progress_update" for a fire-and-forget status note.",
