  },
  {
    "description": "Execute a bash command in the current working directory. Returns stdout and stderr. Output is truncated to last 2000 lines or 50KB (whichever is hit first). The command runs to completion (or the optional timeout in seconds, after which it is killed). There is no background execution inside subagents.",
